# Focused compile-time observation of source container classification.
# It compiles the shared helpers and the Swift helper module into the macro
# runtime, types the declarations in tests/haxe/classifier/classifier,
# and prints one record per case. No target emitter runs and no tree is
# written. Run through the pinned toolchain:
#   nix develop -c bash tests/haxe/classifier/run.sh
-lib reflaxe
-cp packages/compiler
-cp packages/compiler/reflaxe/swift
-cp samples
-cp tests/haxe/classifier
-main ClassifierProbe
--macro ClassifierProbe.run()
--interp
